  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.4.30 (forks 2.4.29) - PERF (WebGPU, WebGL): 64-bit integer arithmetic whose low 32 bits are all that is read (view index math, casts to int) is computed in 32 bits; the emulated signed 64-bit multiply is one unsigned multiply; a 64-bit product of two widened 32-bit values is a 32 x 32 multiply. WORKAROUND (WebGPU, NVIDIA only): the batch is submitted right after a kernel with large function-scope arrays (device loss on the next dispatch; Chromium issue 585125915, SpawnDev.ILGPU issue 10; switch WebGPUBackend.NvidiaLargeFunctionArrayFlush). SpawnJS 3.0.8. Full history: CHANGELOG.md",
